---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cultural & Cruise Group Travel | Talon Expeditions" description="Curated cultural, coastal and cruise group travel with the support of a group travel partner." image={images.culture}>
  <section class="page-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.culture}')`}><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Culture & cruise</p><h1 class="section-title">Shared journeys with time to discover, connect, and actually enjoy being there.</h1><p>Culture-led itineraries, scenic and coastal travel, and hosted cruise experiences built for groups that want structure without feeling over-programmed.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell content-split"><aside class="side-card"><p class="eyebrow">Curated group travel</p><h2>Not every memorable trip needs a summit.</h2><p>Build a journey around culture, food, coastlines, communities, or simply traveling well together.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Shape a Cultural Trip</a></aside><div class="prose"><h2>Experience-led can also mean slower, more comfortable, and more social.</h2><p>Talon Expeditions is broader than high-intensity adventure travel. Cultural and cruise group journeys can combine guided discovery with free time, social connection, comfortable lodging, and selected active experiences at a pace that suits the group.</p><h3>Potential formats</h3><ul><li>River and coastal cruise groups</li><li>Cultural-active itineraries</li><li>Hosted social trips</li><li>Food, heritage, and community-focused journeys</li><li>Comfort-forward active travel</li></ul></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
